## Core Components

### `auto-ui-core`

Owns the execution model:

- scenario parsing
- run orchestration
- adapter lifecycle
- event stream aggregation
- failure handling
- timing and retry policy

Key types:

```rust
pub struct RunRequest {
    pub target: String,
    pub scenario: String,
    pub app_root: std::path::PathBuf,
    pub output_dir: std::path::PathBuf,
    pub mode: ExecutionMode,
    pub widths: Vec<u32>,
